msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Come let me know what went down when you're done your little\r\n"
"sightseeing tour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "All right, I will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "You ready to talk, Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Not just yet, sorry. Still have some things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Oh. Well, come on back when you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Will do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Let's talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Great. So, tell me what happened with Kanda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Oh, Kiryu. Feel like you've been gone for hours. You have\r\n"
"trouble finding Kanda or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "That was part of it. But also..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Also what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Mama, you mind if a friend I brought up from Okinawa stays\r\n"
"here with me? They won't be around any longer than I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Oh, of course. Is this a, erm, \"special\" friend...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Nah, you've gotta be talking about Haruka, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"No on both counts. It's actually the captain of the Ryudo\r\n"
"Family, one of the biggest syndicates in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"And we're definitely talking about a guy here, right? Or did you go and "
"hook yourself some bigshot female yakuza?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "His name's Rikiya. He's still pretty much just a kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Oho, well in that case he's especially welcome! We could use\r\n"
"some young blood to freshen up the place. All I normally get\r\n"
"in here is middle-aged farts like Date-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "What's that supposed to mean!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Hehe, just giving you a taste of your own medicine! That's\r\n"
"what you get for calling me an old lady all the time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "...Well, guess I deserve that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"Anyway, you guys are welcome to stay in the back office so\r\n"
"long as you don't cause any trouble in here. I mostly just\r\n"
"use it for storage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "I appreciate it, Mama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "So... where is this guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"I let him go explore Kamurocho a bit, see the sights. He's\r\n"
"coming here when he's done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Sounds like a damn tourist. So much for work ethic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Everything okay, Date-san? It doesn't sound like you're in\r\n"
"a very good mood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Nah, it's nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"Finally found ya, Aniki! Would you believe I went in like\r\n"
"five different bars before I ended up here? This city's a\r\n"
"goddamn maze or somethin'!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "This your guy, Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"Rikiya, this is my friend Date-san. I couldn't tell you how many times he's "
"helped me over the years. Oh, and this is the mama of this bar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"Aniki's friends, huh? Pleasure meetin' you! The name's\r\n"
"Rikiya Shimabukuro!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Well someone has a lot of energy, hehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "I try, ma'am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Hmph. It's Date. Pleased."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Oh, the honor's all mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Rikiya. You finished looking around town?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "I mean I guess, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"I never found that bikini bar I was lookin' for. I really\r\n"
"wanted to see what kinda heat a Tokyo one could bring, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "(I didn't realize it was that important to him...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"Anyway, Kiryu. I'm ready to hear what went down with Kanda\r\n"
"whenever you're ready to spill it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"Just let me know when it's time, okay? I wanna really dig\r\n"
"into the details here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"We settled? I'll dig around for anything on the man in this\r\n"
"sketch, you get after Kanda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "Right. Thanks, Date-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"We settled? I'll dig around for anything on the man in this\r\n"
"sketch, you get after Kanda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"Rumor has it, Kanda gets his boys to haul a girl up to his\r\n"
"hotel room every night. If anyone's gonna know where to find\r\n"
"him, it's them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid ""
"Mama, you mind if we use your bar as a sorta base of\r\n"
"operations?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, we won't disrupt your business or anything.\r\n"
"Just stick us in a back room and forget we even exist. Well,\r\n"
"Mama?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "Hmmm. I guess you are one of my best customers..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "Oh, what the heck. Go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "Appreciate it, Mama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Just stay out of my customers' hair, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid "Of course, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "Sorry about this, Mama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's nothing. This is the least I can do with how often\r\n"
"Date-san frequents my bar. It's rare you don't see him in\r\n"
"here, glass of whisky in hand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "Besides, Kiryu-san. You're kinda my type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "Your what!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Do I hear a tinge of jealousy in your voice, Date-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "Don't be ridiculous!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "Aww, you're blushing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Kiryu! Can you please just go find Kanda already?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid "Heh. Don't let them bully you while I'm gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid "You now have access to a hideout."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid ""
"Here you can save your game, move items to the item box,\r\n"
"reminisce on past events, and view your play stats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid "Furthermore, your health will recover while at a hideout."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid "Not just yet, sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "Let's talk."
msgstr ""

